   "body": "/claim cloud/i763-opus\n\nPlan:\n- Tests first in `tooling/fixtures/tests`: an unbalanced `</span>` inside a signature must be fully redacted by `anonymize` and caught by `check`; a placeholder signature carrying a member value in an attribute (`title=`, `a href`, `img alt/src`) must fail `check`; any `<svg>`/`<math>` must fail `check` (#768 follow-up).\n- `anonymize`: find the signature's end by structure (depth-tracked walk to the `span.signature` end), not the first `</span>`. `check`: its own walk (independent of the redactor, LESSONS 33-34) refusing attributes beyond the span's class and any element beyond the allowed head/tail.\n- Whole corpus passes `check --corpus`, `manifest_check.py` and the unit tests; draft PR on `chore/763-anonymizer-signature`, Fable adversarial review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
